fe (eroinvari) ruh-hastal\'fd\'f0\'fd te\'fehisiyle lanetlenip yasaklanmal\'fd. Yegane m\'fcstakbelallahl\'fd\'f0a tap\'fdnan ben-biz olamayan hepobur  m\'fcmin-m\'fc\'feteri kozcu f\'fdr\'fdldak ibnirospular...\lang1033\f2\par
